ot eric the enemy that's just what  confuses me  how is this got like whatever you think  you want  how is this guy not someone that makes  you say  forget about what we want this is what  we need  well mike um i i look at it that way and  i i kind of chuckled i was going to  write my headline it's not eric b  enemy's fault  it's andy reid's fault andy reid has  lost his touch  because from 2001 everybody he's hired  and put in that position we've said  gosh this is a great guy andy reed knows  how to pick offensive coordinators doug  peterson  uh matt nagy uh all these guys  and and even before that in philadelphia  the same thing brad childress you can go  back  everybody that andy reid has picked and  put in that position has been fantastic  but now he doesn't know what he's doing  he picked a guy that's not very good now  and eric the enemy  a victim of their success and being in  these two cycles going all the way to  the super bowl  you know mike you mentioned that point  there like the dan campbell hire  right that screams to what tony was  saying  of chris spielman was brought in as a  football guy to run the search  are you telling me that dan campbell's  not a chris spielman type guy so the  tony's point  may have been good but we were looking  for a certain type you can kind of see  those connections there not that the  enemy didn't bring that but when i was  listening to the  the kneecap press conference like you  talked about dan campbell  that connected okay this guy and chris  spielman had to connect perfectly  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights  from nbc sports

